//Roles do allow control of some things concerning the bots but they are "SET" unless they are impossible or changed\CLEARtheGOALROLE, a bot can not spawn at a NON-active command post. 
//But a bot will just spawn at the defualt location if the chosen Roles spawn is not possible.
//An unbuilt command post can be a spawn for a spesific team if it is active in the game as a spawn when unbuilt for that team. When built by the other team it will either become the other teams spawn or simply disable AXIS spawning in that location.
